WEBVTT

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.800
This is loneliness

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.550
Displacing memories of happiness.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.320
I look over all that's left,

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.900
And despair is what I find.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.650
I grow weary of this fear

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.740
That causes a tear in my very soul.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:45.870
I don't want to be afraid

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.350
Of what lies ahead.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:50.040
I don't know,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.410
Hear my voice.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.750
Set me free now!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.260
Come on hear me baby set me free.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:01.240
Distant lands call forward in time to me!

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.240
Break through the blinds of darkness

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.910
To the sublime.

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:09.210
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.770
Taking up in the arms of faith

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:15.760
With the strength of conviction and the hope of dreams.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:21.590
The power that makes what was lost seem like

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:24.220
Something worth keeping alive.

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:24.490
Marks to Headquarters.

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.330
Sample has been secured without incident.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:29.730
Now commencing salvage. E.T.C. 0600 hours. Over.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.630
This is Seeker 1.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.570
Is it possible for us to switch our rallying point?

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.300
Reading unidentified high-level electromagnetic waves at two o'clock.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.870
Team members maintain a defensive posture.

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.880
Security of the sample has top priority!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:50.640
Where am I? What's happening? Where am I?

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:41.760
Wait! Where are we going?!

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:43.500
Hey! Hold on!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.230
Where in the hell am I?

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:29.550
What? What is that thing?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.240
Stay back! Don't come any closer!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.390
Leave me alone!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.230
No! Please don't!

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:37.180
Marks! We're over our E.T.C! What's the status of the sample!

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:38.940
Everything is under control...

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:42.350
But I'll need to revise our rendezvous time!

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.870
What's happening here?

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:49.080
Where am I? Wait a minute... I remember... I remember...

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.510
That's right...

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.040
I remember now...

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.960
The doctor told me...

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.800
He said there was no cure for my illness...

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.050
Don't worry...

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.110
An analysis of your genomes has already been completed...

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:34.210
It's only a matter of time now before the appropriate gene therapy is developed...

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:38.960
Of course we can't allow your conditions to progress any further,

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:43.160
so we have devised this temporary solution...

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.910
And so we slept...

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.970
The doctors told us that in a few years,

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:58.610
they would wake us up when they had discovered a cure for our illness...

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.840
But instead...

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:24.000
This isn't real... This can't be happening...

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:29.740
Oh please... Make it stop... Make it stop!

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:57.060
There you go... Have a nice day now!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.460
Hey Yuji!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:18.090
I think... I've decided to become a Sleeper, Takashi.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.950
They just don't know enough about this illness...

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:25.660
The doctors they say they don't even have a way to treat me right now...

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.030
They need more time to figure it out.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.070
They said they won't keep me asleep for very long...

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.470
Maybe just a year... or two...

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.970
Well I'm sure the doctors know what's best for you.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.450
Hey do what you gotta do...

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:53.150
But once you beat this thing me and you should get away from here for awhile...

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.720
You know go see the world.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.120
There's a lot of girls out there!

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:59.690
Yeah... Right.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.130
I'll see you real soon Takashi!

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:09.400
When I wake up...

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:12.000
Yeah, when I wake up it's you and me!

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.570
We'll go someplace far from here!

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:39.860
No! Stay back! Don't you come near me!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:43.170
Leave me alone!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:02.880
A human?

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:21.370
My name is Marlene... And yes, I'm a human.

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:32.720
Now unless you'd rather die you will follow my orders exactly.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.850
Now if we can get through there we'll be safe...

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:11.350
So you'd better hold on tight!

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:16.080
What's the hold up Marlene!

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.310
You need a hand?!

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.290
Leave this to us!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.980
Keith! Joey!

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:23.190
Yeah!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:33.900
Yeah! I got something for ya! Come and get it!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.770
Damn...

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:48.320
Out of the way!

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:07.300
Now run!

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:10.800
Yeah... Okay!

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:41.030
Let's move out! But leave 'em a present...

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:42.700
Copy! I got it!

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:25.080
Come on what are you doing? Get in the truck, now!

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:54.780
Well... at least the ocean still looks the same.

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:27.970
So what is this place? Where are we?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.710
And what the hell were those things back there?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.550
Those things are called Blue.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.580
They are mankind's enemy...

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.070
The year is 2031.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:06.740
Earth faces the danger of extinction

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:07.450
at the hands of the invading Blue,

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:15.960
a mysterious form of life.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:32.600
Even if the days,

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:36.120
When I smiled a lot,

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:38.820
Should turn out,

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:44.800
To be nothing but a lovely dream,

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:50.680
That would be alright with me,

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:53.540
If that's all it means.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:59.840
My mind's unrest struggling with me,

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:06.020
Recalling the past who I could be.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.410
Gotta rise and be strong,

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:15.650
Gotta be tough but not lose the person I am.

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:18.530
Two lives I have,

00:22:18.530 --> 00:22:21.990
One life I live,

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:24.760
One life I dream.

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:30.860
In dreams I remember the better in me.

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:34.190
Vision don't let me down,

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.390
I'm depending on you.

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:38.160
Carry me through,

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:44.230
When I see... reality.

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:55.750
Being suddenly awakened...

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.490
then nearly getting killed without any warning?

00:22:57.530 --> 00:22:59.690
Without any idea of what's going on!?

00:22:59.730 --> 00:23:01.490
Who do you guys think you are!?

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:03.690
What the hell happened to the world?

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.030
What are you planning to do with me?

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.200
If I'd known it would turn out like this,

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:10.500
then instead of living in this place, I would've...

00:23:10.540 --> 00:23:12.270
I would've...
